  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation and development of WPS NAP implementationplan and resultsframework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant to develop and draft a results-framework, implementation and monitoring plan for DK&apos;s National Action Plan (NAP) on Women, Peace and Security for 2025-2029. 
In this NAP, Denmark commits to strengthen efforts for the full, equal and meaningful participation of women in the work for peace and security &#x2013; both nationally and internationally. Denmark will maintain a focus on implementation by developing implementation plans with concrete and measurable indicators, and by conducting a mid-term assessment.</narrative>
  </description>
